31.steps:
In ARP/ Settings page, Enable Option: "Dont glean source data from arp request"
1. PC connected to X0, suppose PC IP is 192.168.168.100, X0 IP is 192.168.168.168;
2. Use Xcap to generate ARP request, request X0 IP;
3. Send the ARP request, FW send response to PC;
4. Check ARP cache table.

